							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							could they hold their own? completely separate, and still accomplish the <span style="text-decoration: underline;">same content</span>?<br />If thats what you mean, with current attendance/numbers/class balance from an <b>outsiders view</b>,  i&#039;d say no.<br />/shrug <br />but ya never know.
