							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Moot point. EiE and DA are not going to split up. Not even remotely close to it. Both are strong and work together like we were one guild. For the most part, the most maturely acting guilds I&#039;ve ever been associated with. On a scale of 1-10 regarding drama, it&#039;s about a 2. Could they each seperately accomplish the same level of play? yes. But it would take longer due to numbers. But like I said above, moot point. <br /><br />Reyem
