							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15254#msg15254">Quote from: Slayyerr on March 07, 2005, 03:43:51 pm</a></div><div class="quote">So is EiE folding? Is that what you are saying? DA is now a solo force or trying to become one?<br /><br />I know EiE has been trying to recruit (clerics and bards mainly) within the ranks of other guilds (ethics?), so what&#039;s the scoop?<br /></div><br />I would never call one guild talking to those in other guilds a breach of ethics, officers may not do it, but friends talk to friends, etc... it happens and about time everyone got off thier high horses about it. <br /><br />And I doubt EiE is folding just because they are looking for the two classes every guild is always in search of. I can&#039;t remember a time FoT would turn down a cleric or bard app.
