							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15256#msg15256">Quote from: Slayyerr on March 07, 2005, 03:57:29 pm</a></div><div class="quote">Recruiting within another guilds ranks is a breach of ethics. If it was friends among friends, I highly doubt it would happen now. I know for a fact that some of our clerics recruited did not know the EiE recruiters, so IMO ethical breach. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bitching.gif" alt="Bitching" border="0" /><br /></div><br />Sounds awfully serious. Maybe you should sue them for this dastardly deed! lol
