							I didn&#039;t know, I ask. I saw some talk about DA being number 1 and thought they may be going there seperate ways. I know a /who all dol shows alot more than /who all echo now. Was just an assumption.<br /><br />Karshak,<br /><br />No can&#039;t sue them, but did not expect it from them.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15258#msg15258">Quote from: Reyem on March 07, 2005, 04:00:56 pm</a></div><div class="quote">haha, eie is no where near folding. Don&#039;t know where you pulled that one out of...<br /></div>
